---
import type { Locale } from '../data/site';
import { copy } from '../data/site';
interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const checks = [
  [copy('來源可追溯','Source traceability',locale),copy('確認每個回答都能回到核准來源。','Verify every answer against approved sources.',locale)],
  [copy('人工接管','Human handoff',locale),copy('量測系統何時停止並要求人員確認。','Measure when the system stops and requests review.',locale)],
  [copy('政策符合度','Policy compliance',locale),copy('偵測未授權資料或工具使用。','Detect unauthorized data or tool use.',locale)],
  [copy('Trace Grading','Trace grading',locale),copy('不只看答案，也驗證 Agent 如何完成任務。','Evaluate how the agent completed the task—not only its final answer.',locale)]
];
---
<section id="evidence" class="main-section evidence light-section" data-section="evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="section-heading" data-reveal><p class="section-index">{copy('驗證與證據', 'EVIDENCE', locale)}</p><h2 id="evidence-title">{copy('不只展示結果，也驗證 AI 如何完成任務', 'We verify the work behind the result.', locale)}</h2><p>{copy('所有數據都必須標示環境與成熟度；Concept、Lab、Pilot 與 Production 不會混為一談。', 'Every figure must identify its environment and maturity. Concept, lab, pilot and production evidence are never presented as the same thing.', locale)}</p></header>
    <div class="evidence-grid">{checks.map(([name,description],index) => <article data-reveal><span>0{index + 1}</span><h3>{name}</h3><p>{description}</p><small>{copy('以已查核測試資料量測', 'MEASURE WITH VERIFIED TEST DATA', locale)}</small></article>)}</div>
    <p class="evidence-note">{copy('目前公開狀態：產品概念與 Lab 驗證；不宣稱正式客戶成果或 Production 成效。', 'Current public status: product concepts and lab validation. No customer or production outcome is claimed.', locale)}</p>
  </div>
</section>
